WEBVTT

01:37.800 --> 01:40.640
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.380 --> 01:43.690
[Episode 37]

01:52.560 --> 01:53.280
Miss Xin,

01:53.870 --> 01:55.070
we are about to begin.

01:55.640 --> 01:57.039
Please excuse yourself.

02:01.590 --> 02:02.390
Rest assured.

02:45.910 --> 02:47.590
Did everything go smoothly on Lu's side?

02:47.590 --> 02:48.520
When he wakes up,

02:48.710 --> 02:50.110
everything will be over.

02:56.120 --> 02:56.980
September 9th,

02:57.079 --> 02:58.120
the Double Ninth Festival.

02:58.120 --> 02:59.450
Today is your birthday.

02:59.750 --> 03:00.150
No,

03:00.750 --> 03:03.350
today is the birthday
of all Heavenly Talents.

03:06.590 --> 03:07.990
I even saved one for Sheng

03:08.020 --> 03:09.350
to eat when she comes back.

03:09.350 --> 03:10.150
Eating the egg

03:10.240 --> 03:11.030
will bless us

03:11.030 --> 03:12.080
with smooth sailing

03:12.080 --> 03:12.940
and longevity.

03:15.560 --> 03:16.230
Let's go.

03:30.870 --> 03:31.930
What are you doing?

03:32.030 --> 03:32.840
What else?

03:33.030 --> 03:34.290
We're going together.

03:34.400 --> 03:35.600
Don't be ridiculous.

03:35.630 --> 03:37.290
Do you know what place that is?

03:37.560 --> 03:38.079
What?

03:38.510 --> 03:39.870
You think we are not strong enough

03:39.870 --> 03:40.530
to go along?

03:41.079 --> 03:41.880
Don't forget,

03:42.150 --> 03:42.910
you used to be

03:43.120 --> 03:44.520
our defeated opponent.

03:45.470 --> 03:47.530
You're going anyway too, aren't you?

03:47.630 --> 03:49.560
You didn't have to bring that up...

03:50.520 --> 03:52.120
This matter is of great importance.

03:52.120 --> 03:53.560
We can't act impulsively.

03:53.560 --> 03:54.620
That's exactly why

03:55.000 --> 03:55.870
we have to go.

03:56.470 --> 03:57.150
This matter

03:57.560 --> 03:59.120
doesn't just concern your immortal sect.

03:59.120 --> 03:59.710
Exactly.

04:00.030 --> 04:01.120
That old fool of the Tianyuan Sect

04:01.120 --> 04:02.000
wants to become an immortal

04:02.000 --> 04:03.840
by taking the lives of
half the world's population.

04:03.840 --> 04:04.750
The 3 of us have been

04:04.750 --> 04:05.800
peacefully tending to our shop,

04:05.800 --> 04:07.030
and now half of us might die?

04:07.030 --> 04:07.630
No way.

04:08.380 --> 04:09.150
Stop talking nonsense

04:09.150 --> 04:10.150
and let's set off.

04:30.160 --> 04:31.690
Junior, you're quite late.

04:32.680 --> 04:33.950
-Master.
-Thank you for waiting.

04:33.950 --> 04:35.270
Junior and I were drawing the map

04:35.270 --> 04:36.400
and forgot the time.

04:37.480 --> 04:38.680
Do you have any ideas?

04:42.680 --> 04:43.680
For this attack on the mountain,

04:43.680 --> 04:44.830
we will split into 2 teams.

04:44.830 --> 04:45.630
The first team

04:45.800 --> 04:47.000
will attack through the main gate

04:47.000 --> 04:48.310
and head straight
for the Rainwatch Terrace.

04:48.310 --> 04:49.870
This is where the sacred seed
of the Jianmu Tree is located.

04:49.870 --> 04:50.950
If nothing unexpected happens,

04:50.950 --> 04:52.510
all the elite disciples of Tianyuan Sect

04:52.510 --> 04:53.710
will be waiting here.

04:54.720 --> 04:55.580
The second team

04:55.630 --> 04:57.159
will take the mountain path

04:57.510 --> 04:58.510
to Qingtian Peak.

04:58.870 --> 04:59.750
Qingtian Peak?

05:02.120 --> 05:04.240
What's the use of going to Qingtian Peak?

05:04.240 --> 05:05.700
What you don't know is that

05:05.700 --> 05:06.800
my sect's sacred object,

05:06.800 --> 05:07.750
the Infinity Bell,

05:07.750 --> 05:09.310
is right at the top of Qingtian Peak.

05:09.310 --> 05:10.240
The Infinity Bell is the key to activating

05:10.240 --> 05:11.430
the Mountain-Guarding Formation.

05:11.430 --> 05:12.680
Once the formation is activated,

05:12.680 --> 05:14.830
Tianyuan Mountain will be
isolated from the world.

05:14.830 --> 05:16.510
By then, even if the Jianmu Tree matures,

05:16.510 --> 05:17.830
it won't be able
to break through the formation

05:17.830 --> 05:19.630
and absorb the vitality from the outside.

05:19.630 --> 05:20.560
Since Li Mofu

05:21.040 --> 05:23.120
has already entered
the realm of Deity Transformation,

05:23.120 --> 05:24.240
let me

05:24.870 --> 05:25.720
take him on.

05:25.920 --> 05:27.520
I will go with Sect Master Lin

05:27.630 --> 05:28.800
and attack from the main gate.

05:28.800 --> 05:29.510
I'll go too.

05:30.070 --> 05:31.360
I'll take the mountain path.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.720
But this Dingyuan Infinity Bell

05:32.720 --> 05:34.390
can only be rung by
a Nascent Soul cultivator.

05:34.390 --> 05:34.830
So,

05:35.159 --> 05:36.120
Daoist Master Gong Yu,

05:36.120 --> 05:37.250
please come with me.

05:38.310 --> 05:39.120
Of course.

05:39.510 --> 05:41.170
I will go with Senior Bai, too.

05:48.070 --> 05:48.720
Ji,

05:50.040 --> 05:51.370
protect yourself well.

05:53.360 --> 05:54.000
Master.

05:54.800 --> 05:55.400
Take this.

05:56.159 --> 05:57.750
The Eight-Treasure
Heart-Protecting Mirror.

05:57.750 --> 05:58.920
This is Lingji Mountain's

05:58.920 --> 06:00.050
ultimate treasure.

06:00.920 --> 06:01.910
It is impervious to water and fire,

06:01.910 --> 06:03.160
and basically indestructible.

06:03.160 --> 06:03.800
Ji,

06:04.310 --> 06:05.240
this is a dowry

06:05.830 --> 06:06.760
from your Master

06:07.310 --> 06:08.330
to you.

06:17.890 --> 06:19.240
Who else hasn't arrived?

06:19.240 --> 06:20.960
Besides the fallen immortal sects,

06:20.960 --> 06:22.310
only those from Zigai Mountain,

06:22.310 --> 06:23.000
Posuo Sect,

06:23.480 --> 06:25.000
and Tianyin Mountain are missing.

06:25.000 --> 06:26.270
I wonder if those from Tianyin Mountain

06:26.270 --> 06:27.340
will even show up.

06:28.000 --> 06:29.160
What time is it?

06:29.750 --> 06:31.270
It is almost a quarter past the Mao hour.

06:31.270 --> 06:32.430
There is still half an hour

06:32.430 --> 06:33.690
until the agreed time.

06:35.120 --> 06:36.050
Start the timer.

07:26.640 --> 07:27.750
[Li Mofu, I’ve led the disciples
to gather at the foot of the mountain.]

07:27.770 --> 07:28.710
[If the sacred seed is not destroyed within
half an hour, we will storm Tianyuan Sect.]

07:40.720 --> 07:42.270
Reporting to the Sect Leader,

07:42.270 --> 07:43.190
all the major immortal sects

07:43.190 --> 07:44.850
have gathered at the foot
of Tianyuan Mountain.

07:44.850 --> 07:46.430
Members of Zigai Mountain, Posuo Sect,

07:46.430 --> 07:48.159
and Tianyin Mountain have not yet arrived.

07:48.159 --> 07:49.800
Lin An has sent a declaration of war.

07:49.800 --> 07:50.600
If we don't destroy

07:50.600 --> 07:52.120
the sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree,

07:52.120 --> 07:53.000
in half an hour,

07:53.020 --> 07:54.750
they will attack the mountain.

08:01.920 --> 08:02.650
Sect Leader,

08:03.270 --> 08:03.890
are we going to accelerate the growth

08:03.890 --> 08:05.290
of the sacred seed today?

08:11.630 --> 08:13.160
Accelerating the growth
of the divine Jianmu Tree

08:13.160 --> 08:13.920
will drain the life force

08:13.920 --> 08:15.320
of half the living creatures in the world.

08:15.320 --> 08:16.870
If we are not absolutely certain,

08:16.870 --> 08:17.430
I am afraid...

08:17.430 --> 08:18.030
Everyone,

08:18.830 --> 08:19.480
do you know

08:20.480 --> 08:22.190
what we are doing today?

08:23.910 --> 08:25.190
To accelerate the Jianmu Tree's growth

08:25.190 --> 08:27.050
and rebuild the heavenly ladder.

08:27.780 --> 08:28.640
More than that.

08:28.660 --> 08:30.130
To reorganize the Twelve Immortal Sects

08:30.130 --> 08:31.930
and rebuild the immortal order.

08:32.270 --> 08:33.510
Not just that either.

08:45.440 --> 08:46.440
In ancient times,

08:47.320 --> 08:49.250
Pangu separated heaven and earth,

08:49.910 --> 08:51.970
divided the Yin and Yang of the world,

08:52.510 --> 08:54.570
and distinguished heaven and earth.

08:55.000 --> 08:55.630
Then,

08:56.360 --> 08:58.510
the Dao of Heaven
nurtured spiritual energy,

08:58.510 --> 09:00.630
bestowed brilliance upon all things,

09:00.630 --> 09:02.760
and enlightened all sentient beings.

09:02.790 --> 09:03.550
After that,

09:04.390 --> 09:05.930
gods descended to the world

09:05.960 --> 09:07.360
to rule the Three Realms.

09:07.440 --> 09:09.500
Nuwa and Fuxi created the Human Race.

09:10.070 --> 09:11.800
But what about us cultivators?

09:16.360 --> 09:18.440
We consider ourselves
to be of human origin,

09:18.440 --> 09:19.900
but we are no longer human.

09:22.270 --> 09:24.630
We have cultivated hard
for thousands of years,

09:24.630 --> 09:25.560
only to find that

09:25.910 --> 09:27.710
the path to Ascension is broken.

09:28.080 --> 09:29.200
We can't become gods,

09:29.200 --> 09:30.260
nor can we be human.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.000
We are left in the mortal realm,

09:32.000 --> 09:34.260
accused of preying on the common people.

09:34.270 --> 09:35.330
We want Ascension,

09:36.120 --> 09:37.510
but there is no way out.

09:38.750 --> 09:39.630
But logically,

09:40.840 --> 09:41.630
shouldn't we be

09:41.630 --> 09:42.630
next to the gods

09:43.670 --> 09:45.240
as the elites of this world?

09:45.750 --> 09:46.750
Shouldn't we have

09:46.910 --> 09:49.240
a great achievement recorded in history?

10:01.910 --> 10:03.670
I want to open the heavenly ladder

10:03.670 --> 10:04.960
and take back everything

10:04.960 --> 10:06.080
that rightfully belongs to us.

10:06.080 --> 10:06.680
Everyone,

10:06.910 --> 10:08.440
do you have any objections?

10:08.440 --> 10:09.550
No objections.

10:10.120 --> 10:11.690
I want to open the heavenly ladder

10:11.690 --> 10:12.970
and rewrite history

10:13.320 --> 10:14.390
for all cultivators,

10:14.390 --> 10:15.440
and myself.

10:16.070 --> 10:17.480
I want to seek a rightful

10:17.670 --> 10:19.390
and bright future for us.

10:19.600 --> 10:20.200
Everyone,

10:20.270 --> 10:21.200
any objections?

10:22.230 --> 10:24.630
We will follow
the Sect Leader to the death!

10:28.240 --> 10:30.440
We will follow
the Sect Leader to the death!

10:30.440 --> 10:32.400
We will follow
the Sect Leader to the death!

10:32.400 --> 10:34.800
We will follow
the Sect Leader to the death!

10:41.390 --> 10:42.790
Open the heavenly ladder

10:43.200 --> 10:44.670
and rebuild the heavenly path.

10:44.670 --> 10:45.330
This action

10:46.150 --> 10:48.550
will benefit cultivators
for generations to come.

10:48.550 --> 10:49.150
Everyone.

10:49.630 --> 10:50.630
The path to heaven

10:50.960 --> 10:53.120
is destined to be difficult and dangerous.

10:53.120 --> 10:54.120
I am also prepared

10:54.150 --> 10:55.460
to sacrifice myself.

10:56.270 --> 10:58.940
As long as
the Jianmu Heavenly Ladder is rebuilt,

10:58.940 --> 11:00.400
this world will never lack

11:00.720 --> 11:02.630
cultivators
in the Deity Transformation stage again.

11:02.630 --> 11:04.150
Reopen the heavenly ladder!

11:04.150 --> 11:05.550
Replant the Jianmu Tree.

11:05.750 --> 11:07.320
Reopen the heavenly ladder!

11:07.320 --> 11:08.720
Replant the Jianmu Tree.

11:26.390 --> 11:26.870
Mo Guan,

11:27.550 --> 11:30.610
fend off the enemy with your junior,
Cang Fengzi, here.

11:32.700 --> 11:34.200
Fellow Taoist, Xia Xuanzi,

11:34.200 --> 11:36.030
come with me to the Rainwatch Terrace.

11:36.030 --> 11:37.030
It's my honor.

11:46.540 --> 11:47.940
[Guiyuan Hall]

11:59.750 --> 12:00.750
I look forward

12:01.480 --> 12:02.480
to meeting you all

12:02.600 --> 12:03.730
in the divine realm.

12:05.660 --> 12:06.990
Farewell, Sect Leader.

12:07.510 --> 12:10.720
Wishing the Sect Leader success
in rebuilding the heavenly ladder

12:10.720 --> 12:12.780
and ascending to the highest heaven.

12:26.840 --> 12:27.770
No more waiting.

12:28.200 --> 12:28.800
Everyone,

12:29.550 --> 12:31.750
follow me to attack Tianyuan Mountain!

12:32.000 --> 12:33.530
Attack Tianyuan Mountain!

12:33.670 --> 12:35.200
Attack Tianyuan Mountain!

12:35.390 --> 12:36.920
Attack Tianyuan Mountain!

12:37.030 --> 12:38.560
Attack Tianyuan Mountain!

12:38.890 --> 12:39.560
Attack!

12:39.720 --> 12:46.600
Attack! Attack!

13:03.750 --> 13:05.630
All disciples, listen to my command!

13:05.630 --> 13:06.200
Yes!

13:07.390 --> 13:08.790
Set up the Killing Formation

13:08.790 --> 13:11.120
and defend the mountain gate to the death!

13:11.910 --> 13:13.750
Defend the mountain gate to the death!

13:13.750 --> 13:15.440
Defend the mountain gate to the death!

13:15.440 --> 13:17.570
Defend the mountain gate to the death!

13:33.510 --> 13:35.550
Please, fellow Taoist, protect us.

13:38.030 --> 13:39.090
Fellow Taoist Xia,

13:39.240 --> 13:40.580
do you remember that the Crazy Taoist

13:40.580 --> 13:42.270
once made 2 prophecies?

13:42.910 --> 13:43.310
First,

13:43.630 --> 13:45.510
there will be a great calamity
in this world.

13:45.510 --> 13:45.970
Second,

13:46.500 --> 13:48.200
the person born on September 9th

13:48.200 --> 13:49.660
is the savior of the world.

13:50.360 --> 13:52.220
Do you believe it, fellow Taoist?

13:52.360 --> 13:53.870
Do you believe it, Sect Leader Li?

13:53.870 --> 13:54.390
I do.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.670
The heavenly ladder is broken,

13:56.670 --> 13:57.930
and the gods have left.

13:58.200 --> 14:00.750
No one in the immortal sect
can ascend to the Heavenly Gate anymore.

14:00.750 --> 14:01.240
This is

14:01.830 --> 14:03.000
the great calamity.

14:03.480 --> 14:05.030
Only the one who rebuilds
the heavenly ladder,

14:05.030 --> 14:07.430
opens the passage between
humans and gods,

14:07.750 --> 14:08.550
and carves out

14:08.910 --> 14:10.640
a new path of life for this world

14:11.270 --> 14:13.000
is the true savior of the world.

14:13.360 --> 14:14.560
Isn't that referring

14:14.700 --> 14:15.790
to me?

14:17.480 --> 14:18.080
Today,

14:18.630 --> 14:20.320
I will open this Heavenly Gate,

14:20.320 --> 14:21.450
follow the destiny,

14:22.080 --> 14:24.080
and resolve the predicament
of the severed connection to heaven.

14:24.080 --> 14:25.790
I will relieve the predicament
of the people.

14:25.790 --> 14:27.320
I will tear through the clouds

14:27.320 --> 14:28.980
and ascend to the Ninth Realm!

14:35.940 --> 14:37.600
I want to ask the gods in heaven

14:38.150 --> 14:40.610
if they know
the prestige of us cultivators.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.510
Oh no. We need to hurry.

15:44.200 --> 15:45.440
How dare you use such cheap tricks

15:45.440 --> 15:46.640
in front of my father?

15:58.250 --> 15:59.190
Didn't you ask

15:59.730 --> 16:01.860
who the ancestor of this formation is?

16:02.250 --> 16:02.700
Break!

16:30.910 --> 16:32.170
Daoist Master Gong Yu,

16:32.320 --> 16:35.450
please take a trip with Bai.

16:44.600 --> 16:46.270
Tell Li Mofu to get out here.

17:18.829 --> 17:20.359
Three little mice escaped.

17:21.589 --> 17:22.930
I'll be right back.

17:52.720 --> 17:53.380
It's you.

17:54.720 --> 17:55.790
Everyone, be careful.

17:55.790 --> 17:57.390
Something is wrong with her.

18:17.720 --> 18:18.510
You guys go first.

18:18.510 --> 18:19.570
I'll deal with her.

18:20.200 --> 18:20.860
Be careful.

18:21.240 --> 18:21.770
Let's go.

18:46.830 --> 18:48.360
The feeling of having power

18:48.820 --> 18:50.180
is truly wonderful.

18:50.590 --> 18:51.750
You even stuff your mouths

18:51.750 --> 18:52.720
with things refined from
the immortal perception

18:52.720 --> 18:54.310
of your fellow sect members.

18:54.310 --> 18:56.070
Can't believe that trash like you

18:56.070 --> 18:58.100
dare to call yourselves an orthodox sect

18:58.100 --> 19:00.430
and the head of the Twelve Immortal Sects.

19:29.920 --> 19:31.030
It seems the golden liquid

19:31.030 --> 19:32.690
can only strengthen the body,

19:32.720 --> 19:33.960
but not the brain.

19:42.000 --> 19:42.930
Han, be careful!

20:04.270 --> 20:05.270
Young Master Lin.

20:05.350 --> 20:06.310
It's been a while,

20:06.310 --> 20:07.910
but you've barely improved.

20:08.510 --> 20:09.440
You are all here.

20:10.120 --> 20:11.320
Where is Lu Qianqiao?

20:25.720 --> 20:26.520
Grandmaster.

20:27.240 --> 20:28.570
A heart has 9 apertures.

20:29.160 --> 20:31.960
Qian, Kan, Gen, Zhen, Zhong,

20:32.150 --> 20:34.110
Xun, Li, Kun, and Dui.

20:34.790 --> 20:37.440
Opening all nine apertures
forms the null heart,

20:37.440 --> 20:39.920
making one a god who can
command the wind and rain,

20:39.920 --> 20:42.400
and move mountains and seas,

20:43.030 --> 20:45.180
Opening six apertures
forms the Earthly Heart,

20:45.180 --> 20:47.640
making one a War Demon with
extraordinary combat power

20:47.640 --> 20:49.960
and an exceptionally sturdy body.

20:50.680 --> 20:53.110
Opening three apertures
forms the hearts of men,

20:53.110 --> 20:54.550
making one ordinary in this world,

20:54.550 --> 20:55.960
living among all beings.

20:57.130 --> 20:58.890
The more apertures you open,

20:59.240 --> 21:01.000
the stronger your ability to communicate

21:01.000 --> 21:02.440
with heaven and earth becomes.

21:02.440 --> 21:05.350
The speed of absorbing spiritual energy
also becomes faster.

21:05.350 --> 21:07.640
The innate Earthly Heart
with six open apertures

21:07.640 --> 21:08.790
is also the source of the bloodline power

21:08.790 --> 21:11.550
of the War Demons.

21:18.590 --> 21:20.440
The last step for you to turn from
a War Demon

21:20.440 --> 21:22.240
into an ordinary human

21:22.750 --> 21:24.720
is to borrow

21:24.720 --> 21:25.790
the power of the Crimson Flame

21:25.790 --> 21:27.240
from the Lantern Dragon Grass to seal the

21:27.240 --> 21:29.770
Zhen, Zhong, and Xun apertures
in the Earthly Heart.

21:29.770 --> 21:30.640
This will completely dissolve and seal

21:30.640 --> 21:32.270
the bloodline,

21:32.830 --> 21:34.720
leaving only the mortal heart's

21:35.000 --> 21:36.800
Li, Kun, and Dui apertures open.

21:37.720 --> 21:40.050
You will maintain vitality like a mortal.

21:40.300 --> 21:40.980
From now on,

21:41.480 --> 21:43.400
you will not be burdened by the curse.

21:43.400 --> 21:44.920
But just like a normal person,

21:44.920 --> 21:47.980
you will experience birth, aging,
illness, and death.

21:49.270 --> 21:50.160
Later,

21:50.790 --> 21:53.960
I will open your chest
to seal the apertures.

21:54.270 --> 21:56.330
This process is unbearably painful.

21:56.750 --> 21:58.010
Please, Grandmaster,

21:58.590 --> 22:00.590
drink this bowl of Anesthesia Brew.

22:00.790 --> 22:01.880
When you wake up,

22:02.110 --> 22:03.710
your wish will be fulfilled,

22:04.030 --> 22:06.070
and you will become a true mortal.

22:12.590 --> 22:13.850
Undress Grandmaster.

22:14.310 --> 22:14.790
Yes.

22:19.480 --> 22:20.280
Grandmaster.

22:41.640 --> 22:43.160
I knew you'd come here.

22:43.960 --> 22:45.550
You traitor.

22:46.160 --> 22:47.200
Don't you have any gratitude

22:47.200 --> 22:48.400
for the Sect?

22:49.680 --> 22:52.010
I just despise being associated with you.

22:52.030 --> 22:54.030
That's because you're useless now.

22:54.070 --> 22:55.590
You can't cultivate the great Dao

22:55.590 --> 22:57.590
or ascend to heaven and become a god.

22:57.920 --> 22:58.750
You have no choice but to

22:58.750 --> 22:59.880
side with mortals

22:59.880 --> 23:00.880
and beg for mercy.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.350
If you know what's good for you,

23:03.350 --> 23:04.240
stay far away,

23:04.830 --> 23:07.310
and you might be able
to live for a few more years.

23:07.310 --> 23:08.200
It's a pity

23:08.590 --> 23:09.890
you chose the wrong path

23:09.890 --> 23:11.420
and came to the wrong place.

23:11.440 --> 23:13.500
You think the path you chose is right?

23:14.070 --> 23:14.670
Of course.

23:15.400 --> 23:17.830
Spawning the Jianmu Tree
to ascend to heaven

23:17.830 --> 23:19.750
requires absorbing massive vitality

23:19.750 --> 23:22.110
indiscriminately,
starting from the nearest source.

23:22.110 --> 23:24.240
You look like you're destined
for a short life.

23:24.240 --> 23:26.900
Who's to say you won't be chosen
by the Jianmu Tree,

23:26.900 --> 23:28.530
drained of your vitality,

23:28.920 --> 23:30.320
and have your Dao perish,

23:30.690 --> 23:32.640
ultimately becoming nourishment
for the Jianmu Tree,

23:32.640 --> 23:34.440
and a stepping stone for others?

23:39.720 --> 23:42.350
This is gambling with my life. If I win,

23:42.550 --> 23:43.750
I'll ascend to godhood,

23:43.750 --> 23:45.750
live as long as the heaven and earth,

23:46.040 --> 23:48.400
and enjoy endless fortune and prosperity.

23:48.400 --> 23:50.060
Isn't such a rare opportunity

23:50.160 --> 23:51.310
worth

23:51.550 --> 23:52.720
risking everything

23:52.720 --> 23:53.630
for a gamble?

23:54.920 --> 23:56.380
Even if you want to gamble,

23:56.400 --> 23:57.800
you don't get the chance.

23:58.240 --> 23:59.040
Bai Zongying,

23:59.440 --> 24:01.770
actually, I've always looked down on you.

24:01.840 --> 24:02.860
You were able to become a Heavenly Talent

24:02.860 --> 24:03.880
because you had good luck,

24:03.880 --> 24:05.010
chose the right day,

24:05.110 --> 24:07.710
and became
the Sect Leader's disciple by luck.

24:07.830 --> 24:09.400
In the past, you were imposing,

24:09.400 --> 24:10.000
powerful,

24:10.350 --> 24:11.310
and amazing.

24:11.680 --> 24:13.880
You always had to be one step ahead of me.

24:14.480 --> 24:15.110
And now?

24:17.510 --> 24:18.480
You're useless.

24:18.860 --> 24:20.420
Your luck has run out.

24:22.680 --> 24:25.270
Now I am an immortal,
and you are a mortal.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.640
I said you can't pass,

24:26.790 --> 24:28.350
so you must die right here.

24:30.090 --> 24:31.550
Before the God-Demon War,

24:31.830 --> 24:33.750
the heavenly ladder was always there.

24:33.750 --> 24:35.550
But how many people in this world

24:35.720 --> 24:36.830
could attain the Dao, ascend,

24:36.830 --> 24:38.160
and become an immortal?

24:38.260 --> 24:40.120
How long have you been in the sect?

24:40.200 --> 24:41.110
You're older than I am

24:41.110 --> 24:42.720
and have cultivated longer than I have.

24:42.720 --> 24:43.980
But why am I the senior,

24:44.440 --> 24:45.500
and you the junior?

24:48.270 --> 24:49.940
Because he is dull-witted

24:50.380 --> 24:51.640
and has poor aptitude.

24:52.160 --> 24:53.680
All these years,
relying on the Yangyuan Pills

24:53.680 --> 24:54.790
and the Qinghong Sect's

24:54.790 --> 24:55.920
shady deals,

24:56.350 --> 24:57.160
you barely managed to elevate

24:57.160 --> 24:59.620
your cultivation
to the Nascent Soul stage.

25:00.350 --> 25:02.160
Do you really think that makes you

25:02.160 --> 25:03.960
comparable to my Senior Bai now?

25:04.680 --> 25:05.350
An ignorant

25:05.350 --> 25:07.410
and arrogant piece of trash like you,

25:07.510 --> 25:08.310
copying others

25:08.310 --> 25:10.240
and dreaming of ascending to heaven.

25:10.240 --> 25:11.240
What a joke.

25:16.590 --> 25:18.000
If I hadn't refused to

25:18.110 --> 25:19.310
collude with Master,

25:20.070 --> 25:22.070
you wouldn't have been
included in his plans.

25:22.070 --> 25:24.790
Can Yangyuan Pills and
the Qinghong Sect's golden liquid

25:24.790 --> 25:26.720
help you achieve Deity Transformation?

25:26.720 --> 25:27.480
Even if the path to heaven

25:27.480 --> 25:29.210
is placed right in front of you,

25:29.240 --> 25:30.480
can you step onto it?

25:31.750 --> 25:32.550
Sima Randeng,

25:34.200 --> 25:36.000
who exactly gave you the courage

25:36.640 --> 25:38.310
to bark and rave here

25:38.310 --> 25:40.170
despite being an oblivious fool?

25:46.680 --> 25:47.140
Attack!

25:47.230 --> 25:48.020
Kill them!

26:34.720 --> 26:35.380
Senior Bai,

26:35.590 --> 26:36.450
you go up first.

26:36.590 --> 26:37.070
Junior.

26:37.160 --> 26:37.820
Senior Bai,

26:38.240 --> 26:39.440
no matter what you do,

26:39.510 --> 26:40.910
I will always follow you.

26:41.030 --> 26:41.830
But this time,

26:42.310 --> 26:43.770
I hope you can listen to me.

26:58.350 --> 27:00.110
As long as I don't die today,

27:01.000 --> 27:02.730
no one will get up the mountain.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.230
Senior!

27:20.960 --> 27:21.590
Senior!

27:25.030 --> 27:26.430
Then I'll kill you first,

27:26.590 --> 27:27.440
and then him.

27:47.030 --> 27:47.830
How come I never realized before

27:47.830 --> 27:49.070
that I was this strong?

27:49.070 --> 27:50.800
I just took on 10 of them at once.

27:50.830 --> 27:51.350
That's because

27:51.350 --> 27:53.280
I was holding them off at the front.

27:53.480 --> 27:54.590
Lord of Rust-Sword,

27:54.590 --> 27:55.160
are you interested

27:55.160 --> 27:56.310
in joining our Lingji Mountain?

27:56.310 --> 27:58.110
I'll reward you with the
Protector Elder title for the thrills.

27:58.110 --> 27:58.680
Get lost.

27:59.370 --> 28:00.680
Lions don't play with dogs.

28:00.680 --> 28:01.610
That's the rule.

28:01.790 --> 28:04.390
I won't allow you
to insult yourself like that.

28:29.640 --> 28:30.750
Where is Li Mofu?

28:31.070 --> 28:33.270
Tell that old mutt to come see me!

28:40.550 --> 28:42.210
You overestimated yourself.

28:44.680 --> 28:46.410
Greetings, Senior Xia Xuanzi.

31:08.550 --> 31:09.950
Cast with all your might!

31:39.960 --> 31:40.640
It's done.

31:41.270 --> 31:42.400
It's done!

31:51.880 --> 31:53.960
Old mutt, damn you!

31:56.240 --> 31:57.160
Han...

32:00.640 --> 32:01.160
Father!

32:02.590 --> 32:04.350
Han... Han.

32:05.640 --> 32:06.240
Father!

32:29.830 --> 32:31.750
I won't accept this...

32:44.000 --> 32:44.550
Jing...

32:45.920 --> 32:46.480
Jing...

32:58.030 --> 32:58.790
Cook!

33:54.350 --> 33:55.480
Senior Xia Xuanzi.

33:55.680 --> 33:57.080
Your power is boundless.

34:54.190 --> 34:55.250
What's happening?

35:27.840 --> 35:29.710
I won the bet! I'm not dead!

35:31.190 --> 35:33.650
Thank you, Patriarch, for your protection.

35:34.510 --> 35:35.960
Since I'm not dead,

35:36.710 --> 35:38.240
the ones who should die next

35:38.630 --> 35:39.760
are you!

35:55.800 --> 35:57.030
This is fate.

36:10.400 --> 36:10.960
Father.

36:13.150 --> 36:13.760
Father...

36:22.510 --> 36:23.710
Fellow cultivators,

36:24.400 --> 36:25.530
Tianyuan is unjust.

36:25.670 --> 36:26.880
We have no way out.

36:27.920 --> 36:29.250
We either die fighting,

36:29.440 --> 36:30.640
or fight to the death!

36:31.510 --> 36:32.320
Kill!

36:45.880 --> 36:47.190
Lin Muhan, pull yourself together!

36:47.190 --> 36:48.050
Get up quickly!

36:55.510 --> 36:56.150
Lin Muhan!

37:04.670 --> 37:05.670
Kill...

37:21.710 --> 37:24.370
Advancing to the Nascent Soul stage
on the spot?

37:30.230 --> 37:31.400
Kill!

38:14.880 --> 38:15.680
Bai Zongying.

38:16.370 --> 38:17.510
You've lost your immortal perception.

38:17.510 --> 38:19.110
Have you lost your mind, too?

38:19.390 --> 38:20.390
The Infinity Bell

38:20.630 --> 38:22.550
is forged from
Jiuli Red Fire Refined Copper.

38:22.550 --> 38:24.000
Only cultivators at or above
the Nascent Soul stage

38:24.000 --> 38:24.930
can activate it.

38:25.110 --> 38:26.990
As a piece of trash
who lost his immortal perception,

38:26.990 --> 38:29.000
what will you use to activate
the Mountain-Guarding Formation?

38:29.000 --> 38:30.460
With your miserable life?

38:47.480 --> 38:48.670
Senior Bai!

39:05.190 --> 39:05.800
Oh no!

39:08.480 --> 39:09.480
Stop right there!

39:10.260 --> 39:10.860
Come back!

39:10.890 --> 39:12.220
You are no match for him!

39:49.000 --> 39:49.800
Bai Zongying,

39:49.920 --> 39:50.740
are you crazy?

39:50.880 --> 39:52.320
You are asking for death!

40:06.780 --> 40:10.790
♪ Caught in fate's design,
I search my soul ♪

40:11.170 --> 40:14.150
♪ What should I do to avoid
living my life in vain? ♪

40:12.630 --> 40:14.230
You're still young.

40:14.170 --> 40:15.890
♪ My blade stays clean,
untouched by dust ♪

40:14.230 --> 40:15.230
Why do you want to join

40:15.230 --> 40:16.320
our Tianyuan Sect?

40:15.920 --> 40:19.890
♪ Yet it's sparked thousands of wars ♪

40:17.440 --> 40:18.500
There is a prophecy

40:18.710 --> 40:20.920
that a great calamity
will befall the world.

40:20.920 --> 40:22.470
A person born on September 9th

40:22.470 --> 40:25.520
♪ A towering tree worn down into
a blade devoid of feeling ♪

40:22.760 --> 40:24.760
will become the savior of the world.

40:24.960 --> 40:27.030
I was born on September 9th.

40:25.950 --> 40:29.200
♪ The heart hides its root
at the bottom of the abyss ♪

40:29.480 --> 40:35.390
♪ In red, I look at you
with a glimpse of shame ♪

40:29.510 --> 40:30.590
So you think

40:30.630 --> 40:32.430
you are that savior of the world?

40:34.240 --> 40:35.240
I... I don't know.

40:35.630 --> 40:36.630
But if I have the chance,

40:36.100 --> 40:39.910
♪ Being haunted by the spell,
even if it's cruel ♪

40:37.230 --> 40:38.150
I hope I am.

40:38.960 --> 40:41.440
Saving the world could mean suffering.

40:40.430 --> 40:43.270
♪ It's better than being trapped by fate ♪

40:41.710 --> 40:44.230
You might get hurt, bleed,

40:43.430 --> 40:45.170
♪ Between gain and loss ♪

40:44.230 --> 40:45.200
or even lose your life.

40:45.200 --> 40:49.410
♪ Lies a thousand years of grace ♪

40:45.280 --> 40:46.800
Aren't you afraid?

40:47.550 --> 40:48.410
I'm not afraid.

40:48.670 --> 40:49.280
Why not?

40:49.710 --> 40:52.070
Sacrifice oneself to defend the Dao,
and face death fearlessly.

40:51.490 --> 40:54.530
♪ Even if it's soul-eroding,
collarbone-binding pain, I accept it all ♪

40:54.550 --> 40:58.220
♪ Let strong wine carry me into
drunken nights till midnight ♪

40:58.240 --> 41:01.310
♪ Let my soul blaze in brilliant colors ♪

41:01.330 --> 41:04.160
♪ Let the agony of a thousand cuts ♪

41:04.180 --> 41:08.780
♪ Stand as proof that I have lived ♪

41:09.070 --> 41:12.670
♪ Let me taste a life of flesh and blood
in full ♪

41:12.690 --> 41:15.850
♪ Let me savor the many flavors
of the mortal world ♪

41:16.050 --> 41:17.870
♪ Let me face the world's
warmth and cold alike ♪

41:17.900 --> 41:23.240
♪ To live and perish with it,
daring to go mad, daring to dream ♪

41:20.070 --> 41:21.440
Senior Bai!

41:23.260 --> 41:29.430
♪ Don't live in vain,
have a pleasant journey of life ♪

41:41.640 --> 41:45.640
♪ Caught in fate's design,
I search my soul ♪

41:46.020 --> 41:49.000
♪ What should I do to avoid
living my life in vain? ♪

41:49.030 --> 41:50.750
♪ My blade stays clean,
untouched by dust ♪

41:50.770 --> 41:54.740
♪ Yet it's sparked thousands of wars ♪

41:57.160 --> 42:00.190
♪ Even if it's soul-eroding,
collarbone-binding pain, I accept it all ♪

42:00.890 --> 42:04.190
♪ Embracing pain as home,
reborn like a phoenix ♪

42:04.680 --> 42:10.740
♪ Just to trade the rest of my days
for one true life as a human ♪

42:11.530 --> 42:15.190
♪ Let strong wine carry me into
drunken nights till midnight ♪

42:15.220 --> 42:18.280
♪ Let my soul blaze in brilliant colors ♪

42:18.310 --> 42:21.130
♪ Let the agony of a thousand cuts ♪

42:20.550 --> 42:21.480
I'll leave things here to you.

42:21.160 --> 42:25.750
♪ Stand as proof that I have lived ♪

42:26.040 --> 42:29.640
♪ Let me taste a life of flesh and blood
in full ♪

42:29.670 --> 42:32.830
♪ Let me savor the many flavors
of the mortal world ♪

42:33.030 --> 42:34.850
♪ Let me face the world's
warmth and cold alike ♪

42:34.870 --> 42:40.220
♪ To live and perish with it,
daring to go mad, daring to dream ♪

42:40.240 --> 42:44.250
